---
flowchart TD
    Answers([Validated answers]) --> Partition[Partition questions by layer]
    Partition --> Coverage[Count answered and no-view states]
    Coverage --> Threshold{Coverage at least 50 percent?}
    Threshold -->|No| Insufficient[Return insufficient-information layer result]
    Threshold -->|Yes| Aggregate[Aggregate observed facet profile]
    Aggregate --> Distance[Compare weighted squared distance to anchors]
    Distance --> Balance[Select family-balanced interpretive neighbors]
    Balance --> Pulls[Derive cross-layer pulls]
    Pulls --> Covered([Return covered results])
    Insufficient --> Covered
